data: {"id": "2de3562a74f14d77-thinking-parallel_evidence-1449", "run_id": "2de3562a74f14d77", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实汇总\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期 & 调度失败原文（Metrics + Describe + YAML）\n\n| 指标 / 字段 | 值 |\n|---|---|\n| `kube_pod_status_phase` phase=Pending | 1 (当前) |\n| `kube_pod_status_phase` phase=Failed / Running / Succeeded / Unknown | 0 |\n| Pod condition `PodScheduled` | `status=False, reason=Unschedulable` |\n| **Events 原文** | `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.` |\n\n### 2. Pod 调度约束与资源请求（YAML）\n\n- **Node-Selectors**: `<n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789111835041, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

