data: {"id": "2de3562a74f14d77-final", "run_id": "2de3562a74f14d77", "seq": 1454, "ts_ms": 1789111850051, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod resource limit memory (1Pi) exceeds available capacity on all nodes (Insufficient memory) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling 45m default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod..` (fact-12e37f215886) | 确认调度器因内存不足在所有 3 个节点上均调度失败，且无抢占资源。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `PodScheduled` 条件状态 `False`，消息同上 (fact-3a6092c17c91) | 确认 Pod 当前处于不可调度状态。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 设置 `memory` 请求及限制均为 `1Pi` (fact-081ff90a1d21, fact-2f209bbbef13) | 证明调度失败的根本原因是配置的 1Pi 资源超出了集群所有可用节点的处理能力。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `phase` 为 `Pending` (fact-54ade962d9c9) | 确认 Pod 停滞在挂起阶段，未进入运行态。 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 值为 `1`，标签 `phase=\"Pending\"`，单样本无法评估趋势 (fact-acdb7c2c1a6f) | 外部监控数据印证 Pod 当前状态为 Pending，排除了其他状态的可能性。 |\n\n**证据分析：**\n所有 Kubernetes 事件与状态事实均一致指向“Insufficient memory”这一单一原因。配置事实明确指出了 1Pi 这一极端资源请求量。Metrics 数据仅用于确认当前状态，无额外趋势证据。由于容器未启动，Logging 与 Tracing 维度为 `not_applicable`，这符合预期，不影响根因判定。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存资源请求/限制配置过高 (1Pi) → 调度器检查节点可用内存发现不匹配 (Insufficient memory) → 3/3 节点无法调度且无抢占候选 (FailedScheduling) → Pod 进入 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** Pod 资源限制（memory 1Pi）超出了集群所有节点（3个节点）的可用容量，导致调度器无法为其分配节点。\n\n该结论由以下证据链支撑：\n1.  **直接配置证据**：容器 `app` 的 `resource_request` 和 `resource_limit` 均设置为 `1Pi`（事实 #3）。\n2.  **直接失败机制**：K8s Event 和 Condition 明确报告 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` 且无预emption 可能（事实 #1, #2）。\n3.  **状态确认**：Pod 处于 `Pending` 且 `PodScheduled` 为 `False`（事实 #2, #4），Metric 数据同样确认了 `Pending` 状态（事实 #5）。\n\n没有证据表明存在节点故障、网络隔离或其他资源竞争问题，集群调度失败完全由资源配置不当导致。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 32.1s (Evidence 28.0s, RCA 4.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 60.61, "metrics": {"run_id": "2de3562a74f14d77", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 60.625150203704834, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 60625.150203704834, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 57628.286600112915, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7954.243421554565, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2704.3066024780273}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17677.92510986328, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 32101.190328598022, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10816.99538230896, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

